{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52259","headline":"诗（幷序） 二十 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道士头侧方，浑甚（张改作「身」）总着黄。\n无心礼拜佛，恒贵天尊堂。\n三教同一体，徒自[浪]（朗）褒扬。\n一被（项校「种」）沾贤圣，无弱[亦]（赤）无强。\n莫爲分别相，师僧自设长。\n同尊佛道教，凡恪（项、戴校「俗」）送衣裳。\n粮食逢医药，垂死续命汤。\n敕取一生活，应报上天堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}